# The biggest in Russian: са́мый большо́й
subtitle: "Say the biggest, the tallest and the best in Russian: са́мый большо́й го́род, са́мая дорога́я ку́ртка, лу́чший в ми́ре."
tags: ["russian","superlatives","самый","the best","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/superlatives","grammar/comparatives"]
thumb: "band \"The biggest in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Opinions in Russian: по-мо́ему","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/83-russian-opinions.cast"}

## The biggest in Russian: са́мый большо́й
